    'Every engagement starts from the operating constraints, the people involved and what the system needs to make possible. Scope and implementation choices are agreed against those realities—not against a generic checklist.': '每项合作都从运营限制、相关人员以及系统需要实现的目标出发。工作范围和实施方案会依据实际情况确定，而不是照搬通用清单。',
